WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.840
It was tough.

2
00:00:00.840 --> 00:00:03.560
It was a tough deal, and it's tough bringing back the cattle.

3
00:00:03.560 --> 00:00:15.480
Because I worked for thirty years to get a population of cattle that . . . I had a little herd of registered Herefords that we used in the show ring with my kids.

4
00:00:15.480 --> 00:00:17.320
I crossed them with Brahman bulls.

5
00:00:17.320 --> 00:00:18.640
I raised some of my own bulls.

6
00:00:18.640 --> 00:00:20.560
I raised my own heifers.

7
00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:25.640
To replace that herd it's going to take me a long time.

8
00:00:25.640 --> 00:00:27.380
It's been a tough deal.

9
00:00:27.380 --> 00:00:31.240
I estimate we lost 20,000 head for Hurricane Rita.

10
00:00:31.240 --> 00:00:35.020
For Hurricane Ike, it hadn't been repopulated.

11
00:00:35.020 --> 00:00:36.940
A lot of those cattle had not been repopulated.

12
00:00:36.940 --> 00:00:39.360
And most of those cattle moved out of there.

13
00:00:39.360 --> 00:00:47.280
I actually lost some for Hurricane Ike for some extenuating circumstances, but was able to save a little less than a hundred head.

14
00:00:47.280 --> 00:00:49.300
I lost about fifty head.

15
00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:52.680
But I was unable to get them out because of some other circumstances.

16
00:00:52.680 --> 00:00:56.620
But in any case, it's been a tough deal in that country for cattle.
